{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOnHand\">Qty on hand</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transactions\">Transactions</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And InventoryItem InventoryLocation InventoryMovement Item Location On Qty QtyOnHand To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The <strong>Qty on Hand - Transactions</strong> screen shows detailed inventory movements for a specific <em>inventory item</em> and <em>inventory location</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Is On Port To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">This report displays all transactions that have affected inventory quantities, providing a complete audit trail of inventory changes.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Balance On To ToDate Transaction\">Each transaction shows the quantity change and maintains a running balance to help you track inventory levels over time.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Date InventoryMovement To ToDate\">The date when the inventory movement occurred.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Current Is On Rent To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Transactions are displayed with the most recent first, making it easy to see current inventory activity.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transaction\">Transaction</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transaction\">Transaction</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And On Reference Transaction Type\">The type of transaction and its <em>reference number</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Edit On To ToDate Transaction View\">Click on the transaction to view or edit its details.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer InventoryMovement Is To ToDate\">The customer associated with this inventory movement.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Custom Customer Customers Delivered Is To ToDate\">This column appears when inventory is sold or delivered to customers.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Is Item Port To ToDate\">The <em>inventory item</em> being tracked in this report.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Column Is Item On Transaction Transactions View\">When viewing transactions for a specific item, this column shows the same item for all rows.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryMovement Is Supplier To ToDate\">The supplier associated with this inventory movement.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column From FromDate Is Received Supplier Suppliers To ToDate\">This column appears when inventory is received from suppliers or returned to them.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryLocation\">Inventory Location</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryLocation\">Inventory Location</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"HasWhere InventoryLocation Is Location On To ToDate\">The <em>inventory location</em> where this movement occurred.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Column Is Location On Transaction Transactions View\">When viewing transactions for a specific location, this column shows the same location for all rows.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOnHand\">Qty on hand</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyOnHand\">Qty on hand</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Is On Transaction\">The quantity change for this transaction.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer GoodsReceipt GoodsReceipts On Orders ProductionOrder ProductionOrders Purchases Receipt Receipts To ToDate\">Positive values increase inventory (purchases, <em>goods receipts</em>, <em>production orders</em>, customer returns).</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryWriteOff InventoryWriteOffs Off Sales Supplier To ToDate WriteOff\">Negative values decrease inventory (sales, deliveries, <em>inventory write-offs</em>, supplier returns).</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Column On To ToDate Total Transaction\">The running total column shows the cumulative inventory quantity after each transaction, helping you track inventory levels over time.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "inventory-item-qty-on-hand-transactions"
}
